    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Launch Dude </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What happens when <strong>unstoppable strength</strong> meets <strong>zero limits</strong>? In <strong>Launch Dude</strong>, you\u2019ll witness the raw power of a bodybuilder with <strong>biceps so massive</strong> they could rival rocket engines! His mission? To launch an ordinary dude into the sky with a throw so powerful, it <strong>defies gravity</strong> and sends him soaring toward the stars!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each launch, push the limits of physics, <strong>break records</strong>, and see how high your dude can go. Can you <strong>pass the clouds</strong>, <strong>break through the atmosphere</strong>, and <strong>surpass the Moon</strong>? Maybe\u2014just maybe\u2014you\u2019ll go far enough to <strong>see Earth from space</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But it won\u2019t be easy! Gravity will fight to pull your dude back down, so you\u2019ll need <strong>perfect timing, upgraded throws, and a whole lot of muscle</strong> to reach the ultimate heights!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude80 <strong>Distance Tracker</strong> \u2013 Watch your dude\u2019s altitude climb higher and higher!<br>\ud83c\udf15 <strong>Surpass the Moon</strong> \u2013 Break past new milestones and push the limits of human strength!<br>\ud83d\udcaa <strong>The Strongest Bodybuilder</strong> \u2013 Witness raw, muscle-powered madness in action!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you\u2019ve got what it takes to <strong>defy gravity</strong>? <strong>Flex those muscles, aim for the stars, and LAUNCH DUDE!</strong> \ud83d\ude80\ud83d\udcaa</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Launch Dude </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What happens when <strong>unstoppable strength</strong> meets <strong>zero limits</strong>? In <strong>Launch Dude</strong>, you\u2019ll witness the raw power of a bodybuilder with <strong>biceps so massive</strong> they could rival rocket engines! His mission? To launch an ordinary dude into the sky with a throw so powerful, it <strong>defies gravity</strong> and sends him soaring toward the stars!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each launch, push the limits of physics, <strong>break records</strong>, and see how high your dude can go. Can you <strong>pass the clouds</strong>, <strong>break through the atmosphere</strong>, and <strong>surpass the Moon</strong>? Maybe\u2014just maybe\u2014you\u2019ll go far enough to <strong>see Earth from space</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But it won\u2019t be easy! Gravity will fight to pull your dude back down, so you\u2019ll need <strong>perfect timing, upgraded throws, and a whole lot of muscle</strong> to reach the ultimate heights!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude80 <strong>Distance Tracker</strong> \u2013 Watch your dude\u2019s altitude climb higher and higher!<br>\ud83c\udf15 <strong>Surpass the Moon</strong> \u2013 Break past new milestones and push the limits of human strength!<br>\ud83d\udcaa <strong>The Strongest Bodybuilder</strong> \u2013 Witness raw, muscle-powered madness in action!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you\u2019ve got what it takes to <strong>defy gravity</strong>? <strong>Flex those muscles, aim for the stars, and LAUNCH DUDE!</strong> \ud83d\ude80\ud83d\udcaa</p>",
